n–extension moment (2.36%), hip internal–external rotation moment (1.18%). The detailed distribution of relevance score during each joint (ankle, knee, hip) of each plane (sagittal, frontal,\n\nThe detailed distribution of relevance score each joint (ankle; knee; hip) of each plane (sagittal, frontal, transverse) of kinematics (joint angle) and kinetics (joint moment) are showed in Fig: 2B. There were revealing during\n\n",
